Scoped Sony PS3 MSF header reader

The probe, header fields, their checks and order, the codec ids, the 0x40 data
offset and the 1024*channels-byte packet size in src/msf.ts follow
libavformat/msf.c (msf_probe, msf_read_header, msf_read_packet).
